      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Buckley Real Estate are delighted to present 31 Brunswick Street North, Dublin 7 to the sales market.\r\n\r\nThis substantial five-bedroom, five-bathroom apartment is ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin City's highly desirable Stoneybatter district. While the property requires refurbishment throughout, it presents an outstanding investment opportunity with excellent potential for strong rental returns.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Dublin's most vibrant and sought-after neighbourhoods, 31 Brunswick Street North benefits from an exceptional city-fringe location. Stoneybatter, Smithfield and Dublin City Centre are all within easy walking distance, providing an outstanding selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, independent retailers and supermarkets.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding area offers an abundance of cultural and recreational amenities, including the Phoenix Park, Smithfield Square, the National Museum of Ireland – Decorative Arts & History, the Jameson Distillery Bow St., and the Technological University Dublin campus at Grangegorman, all of which are conveniently close by.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally well connected by public transport. The LUAS Red Line at Smithfield is just a short stroll away, while numerous Dublin Bus routes provide easy access throughout the city. Heuston Station is also within easy reach, offering national rail services and additional LUAS connections. The M50 motorway and Dublin Airport are readily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters, , students and investors alike.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, an unbeatable central location and significant potential for capital appreciation and rental income, 31 Brunswick Street North represents a superb opportunity to acquire a high-yield investment property in one of Dublin's most established and desirable residential areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Extending to a generous layout, the accommodation currently comprises five spacious double bedrooms, each with its own en-suite bathroom, together with a bright open-plan living and kitchen area enjoying impressive views across the Dublin skyline. Offering exceptional space and flexibility, this property is a true blank canvas for investors seeking to add value through renovation. Following refurbishment, the property has the potential to achieve a rental yield of approximately 11%."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "High Rental Yield"
      }
